    2. The shape's normalized cell set S defines both the sprite layout and the legend occupancy
    3. Build NxN legend grid; for each cell in S assign a non-bg non-source color (2-4 distinct, repeats OK)
    4. Build the sprite cluster as |S| copies of the shape on an NxN layout with 1-cell gaps; recolor each copy per legend -> this is the output state
    5. Place legend and sprite cluster on a grid (10-18 x 12-18) with no overlap and >= 0 padding
